{"product_id":"orientalism","title":"Orientalism","description":"\u003cp\u003e\"Orientalism\" is one of the greatest and most influential of books of ideas to be published since the end of the European empires. For generations now it has defined our understanding of colonialism and empire and with each passing year its influence becomes if anything even greater. To mark its 25th anniversary, \"Orientalism\" rightfully takes its place as a Pengun Modern Classic.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 128 x 194\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Edward W. Said\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780141187426\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 396\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45632241336473,"sku":"13RB9780141187426","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/71JjwTzcL_L._AC_UF1000_1000_QL80.jpg?v=1763392267","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/orientalism","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}